synopsis: "SSZ hash_tree_root (merkleization) for OCaml"
description:
  "Computes SSZ hash_tree_root from a type descriptor and a value, following the SSZ specification, including EIP-7916 progressive lists, EIP-7495 progressive containers and EIP-8016 compatible unions. Serialization is out of scope. The ssz.schema sub-library loads type descriptors and values from JSON."
